{"id":"ccbc0a46c077469a","group":"90","path":"90/90-lem-kleene-normal.md","title":"Kleene Normal Form Lemma","display":"lem-kleene-normal — Kleene Normal Form Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-lem-kleene-normal","aliases":["90-lem-kleene-normal"],"display":"lem-kleene-normal — Kleene Normal Form Lemma","depends_on":["[[90-df-kleene-normal-form]]","[[90-lem-t-predicate]]","[[90-df-partial-function]]","[[90-df-min-operator-generalized]]","[[90-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[90-df-machine-coding]]","[[90-df-program-numbering]]","[[90-lem-program-numbering]]","[[90-df-t-predicate]]","[[90-df-recursive-function-class.md]]","[[90-df-relation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-lem-kleene-normal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-lem-kleene-normal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-kleene-normal — Kleene Normal Form Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"19a3e9309cfd35f0\" href=\"?note=19a3e9309cfd35f0\" title=\"90-df-kleene-normal-form\">90-df-kleene-normal-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a606838813c14669\" href=\"?note=a606838813c14669\" title=\"90-lem-t-predicate\">90-lem-t-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e860bc8bff2a4e39\" href=\"?note=e860bc8bff2a4e39\" title=\"90-df-partial-function\">90-df-partial-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"523fadf1703582fe\" href=\"?note=523fadf1703582fe\" title=\"90-df-min-operator-generalized\">90-df-min-operator-generalized</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"01ab533da9c8c517\" href=\"?note=01ab533da9c8c517\" title=\"90-df-machine-coding\">90-df-machine-coding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"48b1cea94ba27d41\" href=\"?note=48b1cea94ba27d41\" title=\"90-df-t-predicate\">90-df-t-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class.md\">90-df-recursive-function-class.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"4badec96813b3395\" href=\"?note=4badec96813b3395\" title=\"90-df-relation\">90-df-relation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_k,U,\\Phi_k\">\\(T_k,U,\\Phi_k\\)</span> 必须是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"48b1cea94ba27d41\" href=\"?note=48b1cea94ba27d41\" title=\"90-df-t-predicate\">90-df-t-predicate</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"01ab533da9c8c517\" href=\"?note=01ab533da9c8c517\" title=\"90-df-machine-coding\">90-df-machine-coding</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a> 的同一固定历史／输出系统。其原始递归性与覆盖性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"523fadf1703582fe\" href=\"?note=523fadf1703582fe\" title=\"90-df-min-operator-generalized\">90-df-min-operator-generalized</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq\">\\(\\simeq\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a> 所引用的部分函数外延相等，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\">\\(\\circ\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"4badec96813b3395\" href=\"?note=4badec96813b3395\" title=\"90-df-relation\">90-df-relation</a> 的关系图复合。集合推导式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frown\">\\(\\frown\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle y\\rangle\">\\(\\langle y\\rangle\\)</span> 是集合论有限列连接和一元列，不是自然数序列码。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartRec}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class.md\">90-df-recursive-function-class.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_k\\ \\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\nf\\simeq U\\circ\\left(\\mu\\left\\{\n\\vec x{}^\\frown\\langle y\\rangle:\n\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\land y\\in\\mathbb N\\land T_k(e,\\vec x,y)\n\\right\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_k\\ \\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\nf\\simeq U\\circ\\left(\\mu\\left\\{\n\\vec x{}^\\frown\\langle y\\rangle:\n\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\land y\\in\\mathbb N\\land T_k(e,\\vec x,y)\n\\right\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>由覆盖性取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f=\\varphi_e^{(k)}\">\\(f=\\varphi_e^{(k)}\\)</span>。无停机历史时两边均无定义；有停机历史时，自然数良序保证最小历史码存在，确定性保证任意终止历史的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 值均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\vec x)\">\\(f(\\vec x)\\)</span>。故不要求最小代码与最短运行之间有任何关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>只知道 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_{k+2}\">\\(T\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_{k+2}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1\">\\(U\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1\\)</span> 并不能推出正规形结论，例如恒假的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 只能表示处处发散函数。保留本来要形式化的 Kleene 计算正规形，补出其与实际枚举、历史及输出的必要联系。图复合不对无定义的最小化结果取点值：无见证的输入不属于复合图的定义域，有见证时返回最小历史码的同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 值。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-kleene-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"19a3e9309cfd35f0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-kleene-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-lem-t-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"a606838813c14669","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-lem-t-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"e860bc8bff2a4e39","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-min-operator-generalized","status":"resolved","id":"523fadf1703582fe","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-min-operator-generalized]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-primitive-recursive","status":"reso